---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: English Guide
description: Write LaTeX research documents in VS Code and manage them with GitHub.
lang: en
pageClass: page-home
---
<main>
  <section class="landing-hero workflow-home-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">English guide</p>
      <h1 class="hero-h1">Write LaTeX research documents in VS Code and manage them with GitHub.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Follow one practical path from the first compile to predictable small-team collaboration.</p>
      <div class="button-row workflow-home-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/en/initial-setup/">Start from the beginning</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="#workflow-stages">Find the stage you need</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="workflow-stages" class="editorial-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Core path</p>
        <h2>Four stages from setup to collaboration</h2>
        <p>Work through the stages in order, or open the one that matches your current task.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid route-map-grid">
        {% for section in navigation.sections %}
          <a class="feature-card panel card--{{ section.key }}" href="{{ section.url.en }}">
            <p class="card-kicker">{{ section.kicker.en }}</p>
            <h3>{{ section.title.en }}</h3>
            <p>{{ section.summary.en }}</p>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-band workflow-support-band">
    <div class="wrap workflow-support-grid">
      <article class="hero-panel panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Already set up?</p>
        <h2>Go straight to the work you need.</h2>
        <p>Use the top navigation for a workflow stage, or search for optional and troubleshooting documents.</p>
      </article>
      <a
        class="hero-panel panel discussions-card"
        href="https://github.com/research-workflow-guides/research-workflow-guides.github.io/discussions"
        aria-label="Open GitHub Discussions for research-workflow-guides/research-workflow-guides.github.io"
      >
        <p class="eyebrow">Discussions</p>
        <h2>Questions, suggestions, and feedback</h2>
        <p>Tell us when a step is unclear, outdated, or missing.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
